{
  "info": {
    "name": "SmartTask - Recruitment Assignment API",
    "description": "31 documented method/path combinations. Configure local credentials/IDs before use. Do not run the whole collection blindly: DELETE/deactivate requests are included. No real token or credential is saved. Login captures the token; mandatory password change requires a fresh login. Author: Mahedee Hasan Shishir.",
